firmware: imx: add LM restart driver

Small platform driver that lets userspace restart another Logical Machine
through the System Manager. The target LM comes from the "fsl,lmm-id" DT
property.

  /sys/devices/platform/m7-restart/restart  write 1: forced LMM_RESET
  /sys/devices/platform/m7-restart/state    off/on/suspended/powered

The Linux agent needs LMM permission for the target LM in the SM config.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific]

